// Shared build settings applied to every configuration (referenced from
// project.yml). Machine-specific settings live in Local.xcconfig, which is
// git-ignored and included here only if it exists.
//
// To sign debug builds with your own Apple Development certificate — which
// keeps the Accessibility and Microphone grants stable across rebuilds — copy
// Local.xcconfig.example to Local.xcconfig and put your Team ID in it. Without
// it Xcode signs ad-hoc: the app still builds and runs, but macOS treats every
// build as a new app and the permissions must be granted again each time.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
